                "description": "With its retro look, the Melrose Entry Door Handleset is a great choice for mid-century modern homes. It will fit most pre-drilled doors with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and can accommodate doors from 1-3/4 inches to 3 inches thick. The Melrose Handleset is available in a wide array of finishes; and you can select your interior trim knob or lever for a unique look. The Melrose Tubular Handleset is available in either a dummy function or a single cylinder function.",
